{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20748","headline":"萧宅二三子赠答诗二十首 石请客 · 卢仝","name":"萧宅二三子赠答诗二十首 石请客","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"啓母是诸母，三十六峰是诸父。\n知君家近父母家，小人安得不怀土。\n怜君与我金石交，君归可得共载否。\n小人无以报君恩，使君池亭风月古。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢仝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20748.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20748","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}